        "# SECTION 3: Dataset Class and DataLoader\n",
        "# Combines xBD satellite imagery with CrisisMMD tweet text\n",
        "# aligned at event level via Hurricane Harvey 2017 and Mexico Earthquake 2017.\n",
        "#\n",
        "# Key design decisions:\n",
